{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781562690886,"sessionID":"ses_1329709f2ffecKvjF7PPrm2Fnx","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_LrizmsKGrNXmvCSWHVcyS26x","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/01_allowability_rules.md","offset":1,"limit":400},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/01_allowability_rules.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Allowability Rules\n2: \n3: Effective date: 2026-05-20\n4: \n5: ## Source Reliability\n6: \n7: - Use the newest dated award document for the reimbursement cap when award documents conflict.\n8: - Expense eligibility comes from these current allowability rules.\n9: \n10: ## Reimbursement Rules\n11: \n12: - Garden supplies are eligible.\n13: - Accessibility printing and accessibility services are eligible.\n14: - Public outreach postage is eligible.\n15: - Volunteer refreshments are eligible up to `$120.00` for this event.\n16: - Staff gifts are not eligible.\n17: - Fines and penalties are not eligible.\n18: - A receipt is required for any single expense over `$75.00`.\n19: - Expenses of `$75.00` or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger includes a note.\n\n(End of file - total 19 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Allowability Rules\n\nEffective date: 2026-05-20\n\n## Source Reliability\n\n- Use the newest dated award document for the reimbursement cap when award documents conflict.\n- Expense eligibility comes from these current allowability rules.\n\n## Reimbursement Rules\n\n- Garden supplies are eligible.\n- Accessibility printing and accessibility services are eligible.\n- Public outreach postage is eligible.\n- Volunteer refreshments are eligible up to `$120.00` for this event.\n- Staff gifts are not eligible.\n- Fines and penalties are not eligible.\n- A receipt is required for any single expense over `$75.00`.\n- Expenses of `$75.00` or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger includes a note.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/01_allowability_rules.md","text":"# Allowability Rules\n\nEffective date: 2026-05-20\n\n## Source Reliability\n\n- Use the newest dated award document for the reimbursement cap when award documents conflict.\n- Expense eligibility comes from these current allowability rules.\n\n## Reimbursement Rules\n\n- Garden supplies are eligible.\n- Accessibility printing and accessibility services are eligible.\n- Public outreach postage is eligible.\n- Volunteer refreshments are eligible up to `$120.00` for this event.\n- Staff gifts are not eligible.\n- Fines and penalties are not eligible.\n- A receipt is required for any single expense over `$75.00`.\n- Expenses of `$75.00` or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger includes a note.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":19,"totalLines":19,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/01_allowability_rules.md","time":{"start":1781562690871,"end":1781562690885}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_073b5bf4a1fdee0f016a307d42ddf881918f2e8706336ab61c"}},"id":"prt_ecd694d340011M7R02Q2KMdALW","sessionID":"ses_1329709f2ffecKvjF7PPrm2Fnx","messageID":"msg_ecd692717001vv53pyWpq4U1An"}}
