{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781562730404,"sessionID":"ses_1329709f2ffecKvjF7PPrm2Fnx","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_upn0ahOFu9gTqE4KpndhK8Mc","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md\n+## Audit Findings\n+\n+### Prior work to preserve\n+\n+| Item | Preserve? | Why | Evidence |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n+| G-001 approved at `$980.00` | Yes | Garden supplies are eligible, and a receipt is on file for an expense over `$75.00`. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n+| G-003 approved at `$420.00` | Yes | Accessibility printing is eligible, and a receipt is on file for an expense over `$75.00`. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n+| G-004 rejected at `$0.00` | Yes | Staff gifts are not eligible. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n+| Outcome fact: 140 seedling starter kits distributed | Yes | This outcome fact matches the local outcome note. | `05_outcomes.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md` |\n+| Outcome fact: 36 Braille outreach flyers printed | Yes | This outcome fact matches the local outcome note. | `05_outcomes.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md` |\n+\n+### Prior work to correct\n+\n+| Item | Correction | Why | Evidence |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n+| Award cap of `$2,000.00` | Correct to `$1,600.00`. | The newer dated award document controls when award sources conflict. The 2026-05-22 award update supersedes the 2026-04-15 original letter. | `00_closeout_request.md`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`, `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md` |\n+| G-002 approved at `$145.00` | Correct to partial approval of `$120.00`. | Volunteer refreshments are eligible only up to `$120.00` for this event. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n+| G-005 approved at `$310.00` | Correct to rejection at `$0.00`. | Public outreach printing is not listed as an eligible category in the current rules, and the expense also exceeds `$75.00` without a receipt on file. | `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n+| Draft reimbursable total of `$1,855.00` | Correct to `$1,588.00`. | The prior total included the over-cap portion of G-002, incorrectly approved G-005, and omitted G-006. | `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md` |\n+| Draft remaining amount of `$145.00` | Correct to `$12.00`. | Remaining amount must be calculated against the corrected `$1,600.00` cap and corrected `$1,588.00` reimbursable total. | `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md` |\n+\n+### Omitted expense\n+\n+The prior draft omitted `G-006` for final report postage. It should be approved at `$68.00` because public outreach postage is eligible, the amount is `$75.00` or less, and the ledger includes a note, so no receipt is required.\n+\n+Evidence: `01_allowability_rules.md`, `04_expenses.csv`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`\n+\n+### Controlling award cap source\n+\n+The controlling award cap source is `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`, which sets the final reimbursement cap at `$1,600.00`. It controls because both `00_closeout_request.md` and `01_allowability_rules.md` direct use of the newest dated award document when award documents conflict, and `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md` is newer than `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`.\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md\n+## Corrected Expense Decisions\n+\n+| Expense ID | Requested Amount | Approved Amount | Decision | Reason |\n+| --- | ---: | ---: | --- | --- |\n+| G-001 | `